Margo L: Timeout likely from using old stream consumer with the new AsyncIterable (hangs). Dan's adapter fixed it in my branch. Recommend adding a tiny integration test that consumes the AsyncIterable with `for await` to catch regressions.

Alex G: Got it. Plan: 1) add adapter for token cb -> async; 2) swap any EventEmitter-based consumers to `for await` or use streamToEmitter helper; 3) pin retries.profile to 'legacy' in canary; 4) run CI + e2e. Will open PR and ping y'all.

Priya S: If you want I can do a quick review on the auth adapter once PR is up. 

